      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Domain Warp moves every pixel by a fractal noise, and each iteration reads the noise where the last one moved it, so straight stripes melt into marble. The Master Gear walks the noise one cell a loop, and Repeat 1 brings it back. Turn Amplitude for more melt, or set Iterations to 3."
        }
      },
